### Example requests (VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP client)
@base = http://localhost:3000

### Register a meter
POST {{base}}/meters
Content-Type: application/json

{ "meterId": "MTR-001" }

### Buy P23.50 of electricity
POST {{base}}/purchases
Content-Type: application/json

{ "meterId": "MTR-001", "amountInThebe": 2350, "paymentReference": "PAY-12345" }

### Record usage since the previous reading
POST {{base}}/meters/MTR-001/readings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "kwhUsed": 12.5 }

### Check a meter
GET {{base}}/meters/MTR-001
